    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>You create a soulstone that lasts until used. When its bearer is reduced to dying or dead status, that creature may consume the stone to return to life automatically with hit points equal to 5% of its normal total.</p><p>The material components are a precious onyx worth 10,000 gp and one soul shard. Casting costs 1,500 XP.</p><p><strong>Automation boundary:</strong> Create and transfer the one-use stone, track its bearer, and resolve death, consumption, restored hit points, XP, and material costs manually.</p>"
    },
